格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Chinese exam countdown for DeepSeek Harness. Query 64 built-in exams (gaokao, kaoyan, civil service, CET-4/6, CPA, bar exam...) and get days-until dates computed by pure date math with rolling yearly recurrence.","id":"gh:1333771537","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-exam-countdown","slug":"zimai233/dsh-exam-countdown","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Chinese exam countdown for DeepSeek Harness. Query 64 built-in exams (gaokao, kaoyan, civil service,"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" CET-4/6, CPA, bar exam...) and get days-until dates computed by pure date math with rolling yearly "},{"id":"p1s3","text":"PA, bar exam...) and get days-until dates computed by pure date math with rolling yearly recurrence."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-exam-countdown"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"为 DeepSeek Harness 提供的**中国考试倒数日**插件。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"内置 64 场中国主要考试（高考、考研、国考、四六级、教资、CPA、法考、一建、软考、护士执业……），\n把纯日期计算封装成两个 agent 可调用的工具。日期一旦过去，自动顺延到下一年（循环滚动）；\n"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"四六级等按「每年 6 月/12 月第二个周六」、JLPT 按「每年 7 月/12 月第一个周日」精确计算。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"纯 ESM，零构建步骤 —— 发布的 npm 包本身就是运行时代码。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 为什么需要它"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"DSH 生态里 **教育 / 考试类目非常单薄**：现成的插件多集中在工具链、媒体与设计领域，\n没有任何一个提供中国考试的日程数据与倒数计算。这个插件补上了这块空白：\n把「考程」网页应用（`china"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"-exam-countdown`）的数据与日期数学移植为服务端工具，\nagent 可以直接回答「高考还有多少天」「下一次 CPA 是什么时候」这类问题。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 功能特性"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **64 场内置考试**，覆盖 9 大分类：升学考试、公务员、英语考试、教师资格、会计金融、法律工程、医学健康、计算机、其他\n- **精确规则日期**：`2nd-sat`（第二个周六）与 `1st"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"-sun`（第一个周日）由纯日期数学计算\n- **循环滚动**：日期已过自动顺延到下一年同一天，`days >= 0` 只返回未过期的场次\n- **灵活查询**：按 `id` 精确查找、按名称关键字模"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"糊搜索、按分类筛选，结果按临近排序\n- **两个工具**：`exam_countdown`（倒数查询）+ `exam_categories`（分类清单）\n- 零构建、零 DOM/localStorag"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"- **两个工具**：`exam_countdown`（倒数查询）+ `exam_categories`（分类清单）\n- 零构建、零 DOM/localStorage —— 纯服务端数据 + 日期数学"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 使用"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"直接用自然语言让 agent 查询，例如："},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> 「高考还有多少天？」"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"agent 会调用 `exam_countdown`，例如："},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"返回："},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"再如："},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> 「帮我看看最近要考的英语类考试，列出 5 个」"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> 「有哪些考试分类？」"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"agent 调用 `exam_categories`，返回各分类及其考试数量，用来发现 `category` 参数的合法取值。"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 工具参考"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| 工具 | 参数 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `exam_countdown` | `id` (string, 可选) — 精确 slug，如 `gaokao`、`kaoyan`、`cpa`、`cet-6`；`query` (string, "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"可选) — 名称/id/备注子串匹配；`category` (string, 可选) — 分类名；`limit` (number, 可选, 默认 10) | 返回 JSON 数组，每项 `{ id, "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"name, cat, dateLabel, days, nextOccurrence }`，按剩余天数升序，仅含未过期场次 |\n| `exam_categories` | 无 | 返回 `[{ cat"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"egory, count }]`，按考试数量降序 |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### 可用的 `id`（64 场）"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`gaokao` `zhongkao` `kaoyan` `kaoyan-2` `chengkao` `zikao-4` `zikao-10` `zsb` `guokao` `shengkao`\n`w"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"endui` `xuanxiao` `shiye` `cet-6` `cet-12` `tem4` `tem8` `pets-3` `pets-9` `putonghua`\n`jlpt-7` `jlp"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"t-12` `topik` `jzb-3` `jzb-9` `jzm-1` `jzm-5` `chuji` `gaoji` `zhongji`\n`cpa` `sws` `jjs` `zcpg` `sj"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"s` `yinhang` `jijin` `zq` `fakao-k` `fakao-z`\n`yjzs` `ejzs` `zjzs` `xf` `jzs` `ytjg` `jl` `zx` `gh` "},{"id":"p28s5","text":"`yishi-b`\n`yishi-j` `hushi` `yaoshi` `weish` `sg` `rk-5` `rk-11` `ncre-3` `ncre-9` `catti-6`\n`catti-"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"11` `chuban` `zhuanli` `daoyou`"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### 日期说明"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- 固定日期的考试按全国统一日期收录；时间不固定的（如考研、省考、事业单位）使用历年典型日期\n- 四六级 = 每年 6 月 / 12 月第二个周六；JLPT = 每年 7 月 / 12 月第一个周日，"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"由程序精确计算\n- **所有日期仅供参考，最终以各考试主办方官方公告为准**"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 开发"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"# dsh-exam-countdown"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Chinese exam countdown for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"A port of the 考程 / china-exam-countdown\napp into a DSH tool plugin: the 64-exam dataset and the pure"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" date math, exposed as\nagent-callable tools. No UI, no DOM — just data + countdown computation on th"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"posed as\nagent-callable tools. No UI, no DOM — just data + countdown computation on the server side."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The DSH plugin ecosystem's **education category is thin**: most plugins target\ntooling, media and de"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"sign. None provide Chinese exam schedules or countdown math.\nThis plugin fills that gap so agents ca"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"n answer questions like \"how many days until\ngaokao?\" or \"when is the next CPA exam?\" directly from "},{"id":"p39s4","text":"tions like \"how many days until\ngaokao?\" or \"when is the next CPA exam?\" directly from conversation."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"- **64 built-in exams** across 9 categories: 升学考试, 公务员, 英语考试, 教师资格, 会计金融, 法律工程, 医学健康, 计算机, 其他\n- **Ex"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"act rule dates**: `2nd-sat` (second Saturday) and `1st-sun` (first Sunday) computed by pure date mat"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"h (CET-4/6, JLPT)\n- **Rolling recurrence**: once a date passes it rolls to the same date next year; "},{"id":"p41s4","text":"only upcoming (`days >= 0`) results are returned\n- **Flexible queries**: exact `id`, substring `quer"},{"id":"p41s5","text":"y` against name/id/note, or `category` filter, sorted by days ascending\n- **Two tools**: `exam_count"},{"id":"p41s6","text":"down` + `exam_categories`\n- Zero build step — pure ESM, the published package is the runtime code"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"Ask the agent in natural language:"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"> \"How many days until gaokao?\""},{"id":"p47s1","text":"The agent calls `exam_countdown` with:"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"Result:"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"More examples:"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"> \"List 5 English-language exams coming up soon\""},{"id":"p53s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"> \"Which exam categories do you have?\""},{"id":"p55s1","text":"The agent calls `exam_categories`, which returns each category with its exam count —\nuse it to disco"},{"id":"p55s2","text":"ver valid `category` values."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
